WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:06.210
Hey team it’s Charlie, I hope you all had
a chance to watch the SHIELD Premiere.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.450
I think it’s on ABCs website now, or should
be shortly.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:14.499
People in the UK, Channel 4 hasn’t officially
announced a premiere date for you guys yet

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:15.629
other than October.

00:00:15.629 --> 00:00:20.060
That’s kind of vague, but I think you were
about four weeks behind during season 1.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.420
So tentatively plan for October 14th.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.150
That’s when Episode 4 drops in the United
States.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:29.570
I’d recommend for anyone who feels like
they can’t wait, just try to find a way

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.439
to watch the episodes on ABC dot com.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:36.899
This video is going to be a Q&amp;A just following
up on the big big stuff from the episode,

00:00:36.899 --> 00:00:39.020
so careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
it yet.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.030
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we go.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:48.000
Question 1 - It’s A Bit Windy asks do you
think Simmons will only be a hallucination

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.140
or will she come back as a main cast member?

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:54.170
Yes, she’s definitely coming back for real,
not just as a hallucination.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.149
The third episode is kind of a sequel to SEEDS
from last year.

00:00:59.149 --> 00:01:02.640
It features the kid that turned into Blizzard.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:09.630
His name in the comics is Donnie Gill.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:13.720
Since that was a very FitzSimmons centric
episode, I’m guessing we’ll find out what

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.070
she’s been up to.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:17.659
I’m actually not sure what she’s been
doing since the finale last season, but she’s

00:01:17.659 --> 00:01:19.360
still very much a part of the show.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.720
The actress who plays her is still a main
cast member.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.720
So she’ll be featured in most of the episodes.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:23.990
As for future hallucinations, they’ll have
to address them at some point.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:28.401
So I expect them to continue off and on until
Fitz gets his own big episode where they really

00:01:28.401 --> 00:01:29.920
address it.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.750
At some point, someone on the team is going
to have to call him on it.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:41.460
I’m really hoping that Kraken offers to
fix his brain in exchange for Fitz’s help.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.060
I’d really like to see him do something
totally crazy to try and restore himself.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:48.619
Question 2 - Low Buffalo asks I just watched
Winter Soldier and wondered why none of the

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:49.829
Avengers helped out?

00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:56.549
I feel like everyone had this same question,
they will address it directly in Age of Ultron

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.479
in the spring.

00:01:58.479 --> 00:02:02.530
The script addresses why they were too busy
to help in Winter Soldier.

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:05.579
From a practical standpoint they weren’t
going to pay to put all those actors in Winter

00:02:05.579 --> 00:02:06.649
Soldier.

00:02:06.649 --> 00:02:12.720
It’s Chris Evans’ movie and having them
there would have turned it into an Avengers

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:18.860
Movie, not a Captain America movie.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:22.950
I think it’s implied that Captain America
maintains loose contact with the Earth-Based

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:23.950
Avengers.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:27.740
Like he watches the news and saw what was
going on with the Mandarin in Iron Man 3.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:31.240
Kevin Fiege also addressed why SHIELD didn’t
help out during that movie by saying they

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:36.380
were in the middle of this big HYDRA takeover.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:42.060
So the people in charge who were responsible
for sending aide to Tony Stark were HYDRA

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:46.210
agents or too busy being sent on wild goose
chases by HYDRA agents.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:49.790
A lot of SHIELD’s honest agents were sent
on wild goose chases all over the world to

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.350
misdirect them from what was going on at SHIELD
headquarters.

00:02:52.350 --> 00:03:00.540
It’s a little confusing, but each movie
will explain why big characters aren’t around.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:07.360
Question 3 - Nathan Zimmerman asks Do you
think Lucy Lawless’ Character is Dead?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.480
Lucy Lawless did an interview recently where
she said “anything could happen”, what

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.970
I think that means is that either they have
a plan for her and they’re just saving it

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:18.430
for a big reveal or inside the writer’s
room.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:21.720
They just left it open ended so that they
could turn it into something later if they

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.720
wanted.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:28.050
It’s pretty common for tv shows to do something
big with a character with only part of a plan.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.640
Especially if it’s a guest character.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:37.291
The worst thing they could do is kill her
and publicly tell everyone that she’s not

00:03:37.291 --> 00:03:38.550
coming back.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:43.920
They’re just leaving things open so that
they can do whatever they want with the character

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.920
later.

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:49.090
What I’d like to see is either a modified
Carol Danvers arc, where she gets infused

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:53.140
with some kind of cosmic power or they do
something more practical, like give her some

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:57.680
cybernetic parts and make her super pissed
off.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:01.300
I want more female super heroes with powers
on the show.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.860
Is what I’m saying.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:08.050
SHIELD is one of the few shows on television
with a relatively equal ratio of male to female

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:09.050
badasses.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:11.360
Something I think it’s doing right.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:15.900
Some of you have suggested in the comments
that the mystery alien code isn’t just Kree,

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.170
it’s like a universal language that transcends
all the Marvel Alien races.

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.830
Which would arguably make it even more important
than a Kree reveal.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:30.060
That opens the door for cosmic powers and
even though I think Guardians has the first

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.540
crack at cosmic characters, I think Marvel
will use SHIELD to lay some of the groundwork

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.460
for that.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:41.540
Clark Gregg said many times that Kevin Fiege
and Joss Whedon called his character, Agent

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.020
Coulson, the glue that holds the Avengers
together.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:48.760
It’s possible Marvel will use this cosmic
code as the glue to bind all of the Marvel

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:53.270
Universe shows and Movies, including the Guardians
and all the space based characters like Thanos

00:04:53.270 --> 00:05:00.310
and the Infinity Gems.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:05.260
Question 4 - khatchat ryan asks how do you
think Kraken kept himself from aging?

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:10.210
I’d guess something related to the super
soldier serum or some derrivative.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.020
There are still a few technologies that Marvel
hasn’t unveiled in the movies and tv shows

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:15.020
yet.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:16.622
Centipede and the HYDRA tech from last year
was just the beginning.

00:05:16.622 --> 00:05:17.730
I’d guess that it’s going to be related
to that.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:21.479
Clearly he’s been keeping himself near the
age of when we saw him in the 1940s.

00:05:21.479 --> 00:05:25.650
At that time, the only known causes for that
type of thing were the super soldier serum

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:29.140
and the tesseract.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:45.030
The reason the Winter 
Soldier is still young is because of experiments

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:53.300
the Red Skull did on him while he was his
captive during the first movie.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:58.210
That happened before Captain America rescued
him and before he fell off the train.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.400
He wasn’t frozen in ice or anything.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:03.720
The serum they gave him is also probably what
Kraken took.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:09.800
They wouldn’t do something big like that
on TV if they weren’t going to explain it.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:34.210
So eventually just plan for Kraken himself
to explain why he’s still young.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:38.930
Question 5 - Rick T says It seemed like the
HYDRA person in the Agent Carter scene was

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:43.580
addressed as Heir Heinrich, could that be
Baron Zemo keeping himself young and could

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:46.010
he be Skye’s Father?

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:49.120
I rewatched that scene a few times and it
sounds like Heir Reinhardt.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:50.850
That person is Kraken on the show, Daniel
Whitehall.

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.440
As for Skye’s father, he could be Baron
Zemo.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.810
But what I’m hoping is they save that character
for the Agent Carter Show.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.690
Baron Zemo is one of the few major HYDRA characters
that they haven’t used in the movies or

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.740
tv shows yet.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:13.990
And Agent Carter will need 

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.970
a big villain.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:24.790
What I think is going on with Skye’s father
is that he’s tied up in the HYDRA plot,

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.900
whether he’s connected to Red Skull or Kraken
or he’s a neutral third party.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:31.940
He was calmly sitting in blood in the finale.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.160
Look at his hand here.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.320
He seems like he’s just chilling out.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.750
That isn’t something a nice person does.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:42.960
It makes me feel like Skye isn’t part Kree
or anything, but she is someone genetically

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:53.810
altered as a result of all the HYDRA testing,
the super soldier serum and the tesseract

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:59.280
energy.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:04.190
Question 6 - wrayzor asks do you think we’ll
see more Deathlok this season?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.810
I don’t expect to see him.

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:11.350
The actor who plays Deathlok, J August Richards,
was cast on a new network show called The

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:12.350
Lottery.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.449
He might get a small cameo, but it seems like
he’s mostly going to be busy making this

00:08:15.449 --> 00:08:18.040
new show.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:23.980
Question 7 - atalia asks do you think the
0 8 4 device is an infinity stone?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.610
No, but I do think it’s connected to the
infinity quest.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:38.260
When I say that, I mean that it’s a link
between Thanos, the gems, the cosmic code

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.349
and all the earth based Marvel stories.

00:08:40.349 --> 00:08:45.410
It’s just a way for the writers to start
connecting those things.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:09:06.180
Laying groundwork for a future crossover in
the movies 

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:19.790
and 

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:25.190
on tv.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:30.950
Question 8 - J Moe asks BJ Britt only appeared
in the press for the first couple of episodes,

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:33.560
do you think they might kill him off?

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:36.730
BJ Britt for those that don’t know is the
actor who plays Tripp.

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:43.730
He was spotted on the set of Avengers 2 this
year, so he’s going to be one of the crossover

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:46.170
characters, so he’s not getting killed off.

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:50.690
I think that he’s probably going to wherever
Simmons is and we’ll just see him again

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.700
when the story brings her back for real.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:53.720
Not just as a hallucination.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:58.790
Question 9 - anaya asks do you think Skye
heard Ward when he mentioned her father?

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.240
How do you think that’s going to play out?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:05.710
No I don’t think he heard her, but I do
think he’ll tease her with it in a future

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:06.710
episode.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.779
They cast Kyle Machlaclan as her father, so
they have to introduce him at some point.

00:10:09.779 --> 00:10:15.510
I do wonder if Ward will tease her father
before the show reveals him.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:22.410
He’ll probably try and use the information
about her father to keep her close.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:25.960
Clearly he still has feelings for her but
he does seem like he’s playing both sides

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:31.880
of the fence.

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:36.270
Question 10 - Charmed for life karen asks
what do you think May meant when she said

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:40.770
she was the boss of Coulson and what do you
think her story arc will be this season?

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:45.320
Last season it was revealed she had been spying
on coulson for Nick Fury ever since Coulson

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.430
was brought back from the dead.

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:51.430
So when she says boss I think she’s implying
that Nick Fury is unofficially still the boss

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:58.410
and she’s his number 1 when it comes to
coulson.

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.980
At the same time, I also think it was them
being informal with each other.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:06.970
Question 11 - Luna Rogers asks who’s your
favorite SHIELD character?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:11.861
Right now my favorite returning SHIELD person
is probably Skye, which is a total 180 from

00:11:11.861 --> 00:11:20.460
last season, I didn’t like her character
that much till the last couple of episodes.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:24.240
It feels like she’s the most self-aware
some-nonesense character.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.080
There’s this big outcry because of True
Detective Season 2 was supposed to feature

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.980
two female protagonists and everyone was getting
excited but they it turned out to be Colin

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.220
Farrell and Vince Vaughn.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:34.880
Like two badasses that would also be kind
of funny and dark at the same time.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:39.410
And I think Hollywood needs more female characters
like that.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:46.120
Right now Skye is one of the closest templates,
a tough but funny lead female character.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:49.560
As for my favorite new character, he’s not
a SHIELD agent, but I am pretty pumped up

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:53.190
about the new Villain Kraken.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:58.470
Question 12 - Noe Gomez asks Do you think
Punisher could appear on SHIELD?

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:00.674
Marvel actually just got the rights back to
do Punisher from Fox, so it’s possible.

00:12:00.674 --> 00:12:01.674
Fox was trying to turn Punisher into a TV
Series, but it never got going.

00:12:01.674 --> 00:12:02.674
So the rights reverted back to Marvel.

00:12:02.674 --> 00:12:04.399
I do think Marvel will introduce a new Punisher
character in another series or movie, probably

00:12:04.399 --> 00:12:05.399
tv.

00:12:05.399 --> 00:12:08.120
I think it will end up being one of the Netflix
series.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:13.220
Because they don’t have to worry about ratings
or broadcast standards with the Netflix shows,

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.230
they can and will be way more graphic.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:19.050
The people working on Daredevil right now
said it would be way more violent that the

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.050
stuff on ABC.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.920
That kind of environment sounds way better
for punsiher than network tv.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:29.140
But now that they have the rights back, Marvel
can drop references to Frank Castle wherever

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.680
they want.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:35.640
In terms of punisher level voilence, that
scene at the end of season 1 where Clark Gregg

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:40.830
splatters Bill Paxton with the 0 8 4 gun,
that’s about as gory as they can get.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:46.440
Let me know in the comments though, where
do you want to see the Punisher pop back up

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:53.600
and do you think the 0-8-4 obelisk is Kree
or something more important.

